<title>UK: SOCCER-LEADING SCORERS IN ENGLISH PREMIER LEAGUE.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-LEADING SCORERS IN ENGLISH PREMIER LEAGUE.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading goalscorers in the English</p>
<p>premier league after Saturday's matches:</p>
<p>12 - Ian Wright (Arsenal)</p>
<p>9 - Fabrizio Ravanelli (Middlesbrough), Alan Shearer</p>
<p>(Newcastle)</p>
<p>8 - Matthew Le Tissier (Southampton)</p>
<p>7 - Dwight Yorke  (Aston Villa), Les Ferdinand (Newcastle),</p>
<p>Robbie Earle (Wimbledon), Gianluca Vialli (Chelsea)</p>
<p>6 - Marcus Gayle (Wimbledon), Gary Speed (Everton), Efan</p>
<p>Ekoku (Wimbledon)</p>
